    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "I can't think anyone I'd rather have. Today, as we record this, you just came from meeting with your members to talk about this situation with the US Postal Service. something that I think few would have imagined in the past becoming an issue on the doorstep of an election, but tell me what you've decided to do.",
