        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Adding extraneous elements to the bill will prevent Republican votes.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "The goal is to secure Republican support for the bill.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Protecting the Postal Service is a patriotic responsibility.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The bill should focus solely on the Postal Service.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Mitch McConnell may oppose supporting the Postal Service.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "If McConnell opposes the Postal Service, it would harm the American people.",
