    "turn_text": "Political peril. Lewis DeJoy is the postmaster general. He was sent there in May by the president. He is a former co-finance chair of the RNC million dollar donor to the president. Do you think he was sent over to the Postal Service for this purpose? I mean, the Postal Service does have problems. He was the logistics guy. They do need to be upgraded and so on. But the timing of all of this does raise that question.",
