      {
        "text": "Political appointments to critical infrastructure agencies may compromise their impartiality.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Logistics expertise alone is insufficient justification for appointing someone to lead a major public institution if they lack broader institutional trustworthiness.",
